  Id: BuyTower
  Title: How to buy a tower
  Pages:
  - Open the construction panel. Choose a structure that is unlocked and affordable.
    Red buttons need more Money; gray buttons show locked requirements.
  - Use the controller trigger or mouse to point at the battlefield, or expand the
    live minimap into commander overview.
